  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Pilot of Health System Reform Projects in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot; The task will support Ministry of Health in Ukraine in developing detailed action plans for the implementation of reforms for the years 2010-2014 (reform &quot;&quot;road map&quot;&quot;).  At the stage of preparation and implementation of pilot projects, the task would focus on capacity building (personnel training and education), development of regulations, implementation of the system for monitoring and evaluation of actions within the pilot projects, and on the assessment of results obtained under the projects. In the second phase (after March 2010) the taks would contribute also to actions connected with the direct implementation of pilot project TF099614 The Grant will contribute to strengthen the Ministry of Health and three pilot oblasts governments&apos; capacity to identify, plan, implement and monitor health care reforms in hospital sector, and development of program for prevention and control of non-communicable diseases.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
